data: {"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"## A problem with my questions so far\n\nOn every question so far, the correct answer was the first option. You picked the first option every time, with the same confidence (70) and the same note (\"inside first, then outside\"). From that, I can't tell whether you understand the chain rule or were picking option 1 each time. That's my mistake. The correct answer will move around from now on, and I'm going back to the core idea to check it again.\n\nIf you can, add a sentence or two of your actual reasoning in the thinking field. It tells me much more than the answer you pick."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01CncrrqDmgdc5Gj1XED15EA","name":"probe","arguments":{"question":"Let $h(x) = f(g(x))$. You're given:\n\n| | value |\n|---|---|\n| $g(1)$ | $4$ |\n| $g'(1)$ | $2$ |\n| $f'(1)$ | $5$ |\n| $f'(4)$ | $3$ |\n| $g'(4)$ | $7$ |\n\nWhat is $h'(1)$?","options":[{"label":"$10$","value":"ten"},{"label":"$21$","value":"twentyone"},{"label":"$6$","value":"six"},{"label":"$35$","value":"thirtyfive"}],"explanation":"The chain rule is $h'(x) = f'(g(x))\\cdot g'(x)$. The outer derivative $f'$ is evaluated where $f$ is actually being used, which is at the inner output $g(1) = 4$, not at $x = 1$:\n$$h'(1) = f'(g(1))\\cdot g'(1) = f'(4)\\cdot 2 = 3\\cdot 2 = 6$$\n- $10 = f'(1)\\cdot g'(1)$ evaluates $f'$ at the input $x$ instead of at $g(x)$.\n- $21 = f'(4)\\cdot g'(4)$ also moves $g'$ to the point $4$, but $g$ is being used at $x=1$.\n- $35 = f'(1)\\cdot g'(4)$ gets both evaluation points wrong.","correctAnswer":"six"}}],"api":"claude-code-cli","provider":"claude-code","model":"claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":1380,"cacheRead":9460,"cacheWrite":6786,"totalTokens":17628,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":6786,"reasoning":630},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792860747810,"responseId":"msg_011CgMQhFbJ8byR9h9DzBFit","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":17356,"thinkingLevel":"high"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01CncrrqDmgdc5Gj1XED15EA","toolName":"probe","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Question posed — the turn ends here; the learner's graded answer arrives as this call's result."}],"details":null,"isError":false,"durationMs":0,"timestamp":1792860765169}]}

